# 有些文件不应该被计入langs排名，忽略它
**/*.sh linguist-vendored
**/*.toml linguist-vendored
**/*.in linguist-vendored
**/*.lock linguist-vendored
**/*.md linguist-vendored

# 仅用于 IDE 索引，不计入语言统计
native_code/**/CMakeLists.txt linguist-vendored

# .h 扩展名由多种语言共用，按对应的原生实现显式指定语言
native_code/macOS/include/frame_jpg_encoder.h linguist-language=Objective-C
native_code/macOS/include/recording.h linguist-language=Objective-C
native_code/Windows/include/media.h linguist-language=C++
